OL,3,GNEWSA'Large number' of schools sent
OL,4,Athreatening email
OL,5,
OL,6,FA threatening email has been sent to a
OL,7,Flarge number of schools in Northern
OL,8,FIreland, according to the Education
OL,9,FAuthority (EA).
OL,11,FIt said the "message has similarities
OL,12,Fwith a bogus threat sent last month"
OL,13,Fwhich was treated as a hoax by the
OL,14,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,15,F(PSNI).
OL,17,F"At this stage, we have not been made
OL,18,Faware of any evidence of any credible
OL,19,Fthreat to schools," they said.
